---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { PROFILE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="A short intro to my work, values, and what I am building now."
>
	<div class="about-intro">
		<div>
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hi, I am {PROFILE.name}.</h2>
			<p>
				I am a freelance engineering leader and builder focused on pragmatic systems, team scale,
				and reliable delivery. I help teams ship durable platforms and calm execution across
				product, data, and infrastructure.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What I do</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>Lead technical strategy, architecture, and delivery for platform and product teams.</li>
		<li>Scale engineering orgs: hiring, team structure, and execution rituals.</li>
		<li>Modernize systems with CI/CD, observability, and cloud-native foundations.</li>
		<li>Drive outcome-focused roadmaps with measurable performance and reliability gains.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Selected highlights</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>
			GreenCycle (Schwarz Group / PreZero): Led platform architecture for route planning and
			pickup/drop-off ordering; coordinated up to 50 external engineers; built internal consulting
			digital team.
		</li>
		<li>
			Osram: Cut IoT data processing time by ~90%; built ingestion/persistence for real-time device
			monitoring; introduced telemetry and tracing; supported security hardening.
		</li>
		<li>
			Pixaera: Built engineering org from scratch; moved deployments from bi-weekly to multiple per
			day; redesigned training delivery to reduce costs ~90% and onboarding to under 4 weeks; enabled
			2x revenue growth.
		</li>
		<li>
			Spectrm: Migrated deployments to Terraform/Kubernetes with CI/CD; improved chat latency 1.5s →
			150ms; modernized front-end and backend stacks; led team growth.
		</li>
		<li>
			Xtream-Server: Co-founded and scaled to ~$70k MRR; built instant game server provisioning and
			distributed scheduling; exited via acquisition.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Principles I keep close</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>Systems before scale.</li>
		<li>Reliability is a product feature.</li>
		<li>Ship small, learn fast.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Now</h3>
	<p>
		Available for select freelance engagements: interim leadership, platform rebuilds, and
		scaling teams through high‑impact delivery.
	</p>

	<p>
		Interested in working together? Email me at
		<a href={`mailto:${PROFILE.email}`}>{PROFILE.email}</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
